    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place sweet potatoes into a large pot and cover with water; bring to a boil. Reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r-qNbGmGxXT7qZXrjuQUT5XGW9w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229691-Mashed-Sweet-Potatoes-with-Marshmellows-ddmfs-step-02-4x3_8560-368133026ae4440c9228e5f12ccb0bb2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229691/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain potatoes and transfer to a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i_Oo-aPXhMlriUvftCw2W-UAZZ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229691-Mashed-Sweet-Potatoes-with-Marshmellows-ddmfs-step-03-4x3_8561-448c2ec5cb2a48cf89eb89049e113578.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229691/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake sweet potatoes in the preheated oven until dried, 3 to 4 minutes; transfer to a mixing bowl. Keep the oven on.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w-5RjBIXpf_V5-eiuhw-dgMSqeM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229691-Mashed-Sweet-Potatoes-with-Marshmellows-ddmfs-step-04-4x3_8562-11ecda8013c844609b7320a72047e1f9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229691/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash sweet potatoes with a potato masher until no large lumps remain. Add brown sugar, allspice, and cinnamon; continue mashing until potatoes are evenly seasoned.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bVtNXIMBuFjqyTJogn5li1akxaw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229691-Mashed-Sweet-Potatoes-with-Marshmellows-ddmfs-step-05-4x3_8564-284477958da24179b3df3e48280cafde.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229691/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon mixture into a casserole dish and spread marshmallows in an even layer over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x8ILssgQNB4CAc0gToUfPTc2X5M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229691-Mashed-Sweet-Potatoes-with-Marshmellows-ddmfs-step-07-4x3_8566-a04ec16eacee40e381c8d0647892f754.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229691/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the oven until marshmallows just begin to brown, 10 to 15 minutes. Turn on the broiler and broil for 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
